Embedding model weights
-----------------------

feagle can use the EmbeddingGemma 2 GGUF embedding model, developed by Google
DeepMind and distributed under the Apache License 2.0. Those model weights are
NOT part of this repository and are NOT covered by the MIT License of the
feagle source code. They are downloaded separately, only on explicit user
request (for example, during `feagle setup`).

Third-party components
----------------------

- SQLite (public domain), including the FTS5 extension (blessing).
- sqlite-vec (MIT OR Apache-2.0), loaded as a SQLite extension.
- snowballstemmer (BSD-3-Clause), used for Russian stemming.
- llama.cpp / llama-server (MIT), used as a separate process when available.
- poppler-utils / pdftotext (GPL-2.0-or-later), invoked as a separate process
  when PDF support is enabled.
- tesseract (Apache-2.0) and tesseract language data (Apache-2.0), invoked as a
  separate process when OCR is enabled.
